# DIBAY Community D-Point Financial HARD LOCK

**HARD LOCK (2026-08-11).** Full doc: `docs/dibay-community-dpoint-financial-hard-lock.md`.

## Authority

| Concern | Owner |
|---|---|
| Level 1 accept | `lib/community-points/content-acceptance.ts` |
| Level 2 eligibility | `lib/community-points/reward-eligibility.ts` |
| Policy resolve | `lib/community-points/policy-resolver.ts` |
| Amount | deterministic hash — not `Math.random` |
| Credit / reclaim | `apply_community_point_reward` / `apply_community_point_reclaim` |
| Member/Admin history | same `point_ledger` row |

## DO NOT (without reopen)

- Fire-and-forget credit after INSERT as the writer
- `Math.random` / client amount / probability-bucket product random
- Skip reversal on insufficient balance; 0-clamp to hide debt
- Negative spend for member purchases (reversal-only negative)
- Community-only balance; Business Credit mix
- New comment-report writer; community_reports → sanctions
- Hidden policy fallback; treat feed `max_posts_per_day` as reward cap

## Gate

```bash
npm run verify:community-dpoint-financial-hard-lock
```
